  "bio": "Bartosz Suszko is an extremely skilled tattoo artist based in Cologne, Germany, who specializes in the intricate 'dotwork' style. Not only is his attention to detail impeccable, but he is well-traveled, enabling him to draw inspirations from various cultures across the world, ultimately enriching his art. With guest spots in cities like Berlin and Paris, his work continually evolves, which is showcased through the creations on his workshop, @makushka.ttt.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Cologne, North-rhine-westphalia, Germany",
